{"id":"8e213c2da24d86eb","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-continuum-incomparable.md","title":"连续统多个两两不可比的 Turing 度","display":"thm-continuum-incomparable — 连续统多个两两不可比的 Turing 度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-continuum-incomparable","aliases":["20-thm-continuum-incomparable"],"display":"thm-continuum-incomparable — 连续统多个两两不可比的 Turing 度","chapter":"6","section":"6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.1.7","source_printed_pages":[134],"source_pdf_pages":[168],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-kleene-post]]","[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-continuum-incomparable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-continuum-incomparable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-continuum-incomparable — 连续统多个两两不可比的 Turing 度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.1.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>134</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>168</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02c10d5d18aba717\" href=\"?note=02c10d5d18aba717\" title=\"20-thm-kleene-post\">20-thm-kleene-post</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 使用通常的二进制路径编码。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02c10d5d18aba717\" href=\"?note=02c10d5d18aba717\" title=\"20-thm-kleene-post\">20-thm-kleene-post</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}incomparable}\\vdash\n\\exists F:2^\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\forall X\\ne Y\\ [F(X)\\not\\le_TF(Y)\\land F(Y)\\not\\le_TF(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}incomparable}\\vdash\n\\exists F:2^\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\forall X\\ne Y\\ [F(X)\\not\\le_TF(Y)\\land F(Y)\\not\\le_TF(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>构造有限树的增长序列。第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 步先将每个旧叶分裂为两个不相容延伸，再对当步有限多个不同叶对逐一实施 Kleene–Post 的两向对角化，使对应任意无限延伸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\ne\\Phi_e^V\">\\(U\\ne\\Phi_e^V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\ne\\Phi_e^U\">\\(V\\ne\\Phi_e^U\\)</span>。每次替换叶只作延伸，故已满足的要求不会破坏；同一旧叶的两个后代保持不相容。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为所有阶段前缀的并。</p>\n<p>每个二进制选择序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 确定唯一增长叶链，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(X)\">\\(F(X)\\)</span> 为其并。不同选择序列自某层起位于不同叶上；对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，在足够晚的阶段重新处理所有指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le e\">\\(\\le e\\)</span> 的不同叶对，保证这两条路径不被第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个泛函互算。这个“处理所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le e\">\\(\\le e\\)</span>”调度显式补足分叉发生在第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 步以后的情况。故两两不可比，映射也单射；不同 Turing 度恰有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span> 个，因为集合总数也是此数。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.1.7；印刷页 134；PDF 第 168 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-kleene-post","status":"resolved","id":"02c10d5d18aba717","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-kleene-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-kleene-post","status":"resolved","id":"02c10d5d18aba717","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}incomparable}\\vdash\n\\exists F:2^\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\forall X\\ne Y\\ [F(X)\\not\\le_TF(Y)\\land F(Y)\\not\\le_TF(X)].","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"U\\ne\\Phi_e^V","display":false},{"tex":"V\\ne\\Phi_e^U","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"F(X)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\le e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\le e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"2^{\\aleph_0}","display":false}],"bytes":1952,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["02c10d5d18aba717","93a810534b87b0f9","52376918bee1945e"]}